 value problem:\n$y^{′} = 3x + 4y, y(-1) =-\\frac{1}{2}$\nUse the trapezoidal method with two steps to approximate $y(0)$ and $y(1)$, rounded to two decimal places.$2.89$ {{field-1}} {{field-2}}"}]}
